ey":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","绝对防御"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","絶対防御"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","获得高额的护盾，并使所有更靠后的友军获得护盾，且额外强化“灾厄枢纽”上的友军。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","大量のシールド値を獲得し、自身より後ろの味方全員にもシールドを付与。さらに、「災厄中枢」上の味方を強化"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","发出怒吼，为自己施加抵御值等同于450% + 60% ATK的护盾，并为比自身更靠后的每位友军施加抵御值等同于400% + 40% ATK的护盾，持续6秒。若场上存在“灾厄枢纽”，则还会使其获得强化，在后续8秒内额外为其中的友军提高40 + 4点攻击速度。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","咆哮を上げ、自身に450% + 60% ATK分のシールドを、自身より後ろの味方全員に400% + 40% ATK分のシールドを6秒間付与。フィールド上に「災厄中枢」が存在する場合、「災厄中枢」を強化：8秒間、「災厄中枢」上の味方の攻撃速度+40 + 4"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":59,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":118,"end":122,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":47,"end":53,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":123,"end":127,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":39,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backward"},{"start":55,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backward"},{"start":43,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","为自己施加的护盾抵御值提升至500% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","自身に付与するシールド値が500% + 60% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"po